# The bench: raw material for capture (your best work, your emails). Stays on this computer.
bench/*
!bench/README.md

# Secrets never go in a brain. Keep them in a password manager.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*token*
*secret*

# Local Claude state
.claude/settings.local.json

# Computer clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
